.SH HISTORY
.IX Header "HISTORY"
These functions were added in OpenSSL 3.5.
.PP
\&\fBSSL_listen_ex()\fR was added in OpenSSL 4.0.
.PP
DTLS listener support (including the \fBSSL_LISTENER_FLAG_ADDRESS_VALIDATION\fR,
\&\fBSSL_LISTENER_FLAG_NO_VALIDATE\fR and \fBSSL_LISTENER_FLAG_SINGLE_THREAD\fR
flags) was added in OpenSSL 4.1.
.PP
The DTLS listener tunables \fBSSL_VALUE_DTLS_LISTENER_MAX_PENDING_CONNS\fR,
\&\fBSSL_VALUE_DTLS_LISTENER_PENDING_TIMEOUT\fR and
\&\fBSSL_VALUE_DTLS_LISTENER_MAX_DGRAM_SIZE\fR, accessed via
\&\fBSSL_get_value_uint\fR\|(3) and \fBSSL_set_value_uint\fR\|(3), were added in
